# BIM Coordination AI

This project is an AI-assisted BIM coordination triage service.

- Keep coordination logic vendor-neutral; use connectors for ACC, BCF, Solibri, and Navisworks.
- Treat AI output as advisory. Flag life-safety and uncertain cases for human review.
- Prefer small, focused changes in `src/bim_coordination_ai/`.
- Match existing Python style: typed models, async services, minimal abstractions.
- Run tests with `python -m pytest` before finishing substantive changes.
